s=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Injury and Health Management</strong> – Push too hard and you’ll pay the price. Stay sharp and recover smart.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740090/extras/6be75d48f9db4493832581b94d0fc305.avif?t=1783006273\" width=800 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740090/extras/5957a23e430f07fd464f7562f3f31491.avif?t=1783006273\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740090/extras_big/5957a23e430f07fd464f7562f3f31491.webp?t=1783006273 width=1560 height=975 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Visuals, Modern Depth</strong> – A throwback art style combined with modern gameplay systems and detail.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740090/extras/128397216635c75117ca50348b4159a1.avif?t=1783006273\" width=800 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a hardcore fight fan or just love a gritty, underdog story with old-school flavor, <i>Bruisers 2D Boxing</i> brings to you the chance to create your own boxing journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alongside the gameplay, Bruisers benefits from a 16 bit inspired soundtrack, with hours of music lovingly handcrafted by Nick Bassett.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740090/extras/205a539229be